{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アルバムラスト握手会でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/10/5294678/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日の生誕祭はコチラ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部終わり ろってぃー\n2部終わり ゆったん\n3部終わり きいちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめぺろです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田レーンレポ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊髪型"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1～3部"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/10/5294678/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ストレート"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4・5部\n巻き高めポニー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊衣装"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アルバムなので\n11th～14thの表題曲とアンダー曲の衣装のみの\n握手会でした！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部\n嫉妬の権利(まあや)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色が3種類あって自分のはピンクなんだけど\nこのデザインは水色の方が好みで\nまあやのをお借りしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/10/5294678/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブとかでしょっちゅう着てるし\nたまには別の色がいいかなー？とも思って！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2部\n太陽ノックMV(みさみさ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブでもたぶん着てないかな？\nMVでしか見ないから一番のレア衣装でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/10/5294678/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3部\n君は僕と会わない方がよかったのかな(中田)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブ3rdシーズンを思い出しますね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都、幕張アルバム個別で衣装さんが\n花冠を持ってきてなかったんだけど\nこの衣装めっちゃ好きだから\n持ってきてもらえるようにお願いして\n今日は持ってきてもらいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/10/5294678/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4部\nポピパッパパー (まいやん)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/10/5294678/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アルバム個別で\nポピパ3回も着ちゃってますよ！\nまいまいのとまりちゃのを以前に着ましたね～\n全部デザインが違うし\nこういう系統の服すごく好き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/10/5294678/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5部\n別れ際、もっと好きになる(中田)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の衣装の中では一番思い出の曲だから\n最後までとっておきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダー曲でフロントをやらせていただいた曲です。\nあとは全部アンダー2列目です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/10/5294678/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひぇー\n怖いね...鳥肌とまらないね...頑張りますね..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊会話"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏の全国ツアー\n沈金\nカナコの部屋\nシンカー\nラップ\nラーメン\n乃木中 父の日\n乃木恋\n46時間TV\nのぎ天2\n口約束\n欲望のリインカーネーション\nエコパ\n飯ぺろ\nカナヲ\n株\nじょしらく\nアイドル\nゴルフ\n宿題\nブログ、モバメ、755"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"etc."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はアルバムの握手会なのに\nたくさんの方が来てくださって良かった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/10/5294678/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさん\n本当にありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/10/5294678/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}